ng weapons that were once only seen in cinematic scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Never give up, Never surrender!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This phrase is the central catchphrase of Oh! Robot and a philosophical message for all of us living in today\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It\u2019s also a motto I send to myself as a solo game developer a message straight to my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.poster.avif?t=1773034358\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.webm?t=1773034358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.mp4?t=1773034358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/3dcf9cca738944e4870823e223beb0bc.avif?t=1773034358\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> [ Story Mode ]</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>3Level Difficulty System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game offers three difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, and Hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the difficulty increases, rampaging robots gain more health and attack power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\